Usage Rules:
- You must specify and configure an AWS provider. You should not supply any configuration around AWS credentials,
  which will be handled by the build
- You must not specify any alternative backend configuration for terraform
- You must have a `config.tfvars` file that contains all the variables that need to be supplied; if all values
  are hard-coded (not recommended), the file still must exist, but may be empty
- The AWS provider should be configured to include the team name as part of the tags on all created resources (`Team=<team_name>`)